cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Gender Filter Paywall Audit: Random Video Chat Platforms"
abstract: >-
  An audit of 17 random video chat platforms recording whether each offers a
  gender filter, what it costs, and how the platform's public claims compare
  with what its purchase screen displays. Eleven platforms have a gender
  filter; none is usable free by a new account. Eleven rows are verified by
  in-product screenshot, six from platforms' own published pages.
